    "5-2-1": {
      "title": "SOP封装工艺",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "numTitle",
          "text": "1. SOP封装工艺流程"
        },
        {
          "type": "html",
          "html": "<table class=\"params-table\"><thead><tr><th>SOP工艺流程</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>序号</td><td>工序选择</td><td>设备选择</td><td>说明</td><td>图示</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>1.贴膜</td><td>A1.贴膜机</td><td>背面研磨保护</td><td rowspan=\"3\"><img loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" src=\"assets/images/chapter5/sop_process_1.png\" style=\"max-width:200px\"></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>2.背面研磨</td><td>A2.抛光机</td><td>减薄</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>3.切割</td><td>B2.机械切割机</td><td>将晶圆上晶粒(Die)切割分离</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>5.粘贴芯片到引线框架</td><td>C2.粘晶机</td><td>将芯片(Die)固定在引脚架上</td><td><img loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" src=\"assets/images/chapter5/sop_process_2.png\" style=\"max-width:200px\"></td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>6.键合</td><td>D1.金丝球焊机</td><td>用金线或铝线将晶粒焊盘连接到导脚架的内引脚</td><td rowspan=\"2\"><img loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" src=\"assets/images/chapter5/sop_process_3.png\" style=\"max-width:200px\"></td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>7.探针测试</td><td>L2.探针测试机</td><td>测试通断</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>8.封胶</td><td>E.封胶机</td><td>将芯片与引线框架“包装”起来</td><td><img loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" src=\"assets/images/chapter5/sop_process_4.png\" style=\"max-width:200px\"></td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>9.切筋</td><td>I.切筋成形机</td><td>将芯片与导脚架分开</td><td rowspan=\"2\"><img loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" src=\"assets/images/chapter5/sop_process_5.png\" style=\"max-width:200px\"></td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>10.引线电镀</td><td>F.引线电镀机</td><td>芯片引脚电镀铅锡</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>I3.成形</td><td>I.切筋成形机</td><td>芯片引脚成形</td><td rowspan=\"4\"><img loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" src=\"assets/images/chapter5/sop_process_6.png\" style=\"max-width:200px\"></td></tr><tr><td>11</td><td>12.印字</td><td>H.激光印字机</td><td>印规格</td></tr><tr><td>12</td><td>15.老化测试</td><td>L3.老化测试机</td><td>终测</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>14.测试分选包装</td><td>L1.测试分选机</td><td>按性能分选，并包装成盘装Tray或管装Tube</td></tr></tbody></table>"
